BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:IU Maurer School of Law
DTSTART:20260908T160000Z
DTEND:20260908T170000Z
LOCATION:LOWELL E. BAIER HALL/IU MAURER SCHOOL OF LAW
GEO:39.165074;-86.526424
SUMMARY:OLL Callout Meeting
DESCRIPTION:Outreach for Legal Literacy (OLL) is a pro bono student organ
 ization that partners with Bloomington elementary schools to teach 5th gr
 ade students about the legal profession\, the justice system\, and the ro
 le lawyers play in society. Through interactive lessons\, law students he
 lp inspire curiosity about the law and promote legal literacy in our comm
 unity.  Volunteers also assist 5th grade students in fun and exciting moc
 k trials to practice the skills taught to them (last year's criminal mock
  trial involved thrilling Minecraft body-camera footage)!  Whether you're
  passionate about community engagement\, education\, or simply looking fo
 r a meaningful way to give back\, we'd love to have you join us! No prior
  teaching experience is required—just a willingness to learn and make a
  positive impact. Join us to learn about the program\, how to get involve
 d\, commitment levels\, and additional information!&#160\;
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  Outreach for Legal Literacy (OLL) is a 
 pro bono student organization that partners with Bloomington elementary s
 chools to teach 5th grade students about the legal profession\, the justi
 ce system\, and the role lawyers play in society. Through interactive les
 sons\, law students help inspire curiosity about the law and promote lega
 l literacy in our community.</p><p>  Volunteers also assist 5th grade stu
 dents in fun and exciting mock trials to practice the skills taught to th
 em (last year's criminal mock trial involved thrilling Minecraft body-cam
 era footage)!</p><p>  Whether you're passionate about community engagemen
 t\, education\, or simply looking for a meaningful way to give back\, we'
 d love to have you join us! No prior teaching experience is required—ju
 st a willingness to learn and make a positive impact. Join us to learn ab
 out the program\, how to get involved\, commitment levels\, and additiona
 l information!&#160\;</p>
UID:20260908T160000Z-2363263@events.iu.edu
DTSTAMP:20260728T133800Z
URL:https://events.iu.edu/lawiub/event/2363263-oll-callout-meeting
CATEGORIES:Student-run
LAST-MODIFIED:20260728T173800Z
X-LIVEWHALE-TYPE:events
X-LIVEWHALE-ID:2363263
X-LIVEWHALE-TIMEZONE:America/New_York
X-LIVEWHALE-CONTACT-INFO:<p>Brennan Cox&#160\;<br />\nPresident of Outrea
 ch for Legal Literacy&#160\;</p>
X-LIVEWHALE-TAGS:Outreach for Legal Literacy
END:VEVENT
