DESCRIPTION:Join the Maurer Career Services Office on Thursday\, Septembe
 r 10 from 5:00-7:00 for the 2026 Career Expo.  Designed for first-year la
 w students\, the Career Expo provides an opportunity to connect with atto
 rneys and legal employers from a variety of practice settings. Students c
 an learn about different practice areas and organizations\, ask questions
  about legal careers\, and begin building professional relationships earl
 y in their law school experience.  Additional event details\, including t
 he schedule and participating employers\, will be shared as they become a
 vailable.
