SUMMARY:Northwestern Tax LLM Info Session
DESCRIPTION:Join us on Wednesday\, September 23rd from 12:00-1:00 pm in R
 oom 213 as we welcome Professor Ajay Mehrotra from Northwestern Universit
 y Pritzker School of Law to learn about Northwestern's Tax LLM Program.  
 At this session\, you can learn what advanced study in tax law at Northwe
 stern looks like\, including extensive curricular offerings from an exper
 t group of faculty and tax professionals\, networking and career opportun
 ities\, and flexible degree options.  Lunch will be provided to students 
 who RSVP.  If you are interested in attending\, you must RSVP by Septembe
 r 20. We look forward to seeing you there!
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  Join us on Wednesday\, September 23rd f
 rom 12:00-1:00 pm in Room 213 as we welcome Professor Ajay Mehrotra from 
 Northwestern University Pritzker School of Law to learn about Northwester
 n's Tax LLM Program.</p><p>  At this session\, you can learn what advance
 d study in tax law at Northwestern looks like\, including extensive curri
 cular offerings from an expert group of faculty and tax professionals\, n
 etworking and career opportunities\, and flexible degree options.</p><p> 
  Lunch will be provided to students who RSVP.</p><p>  If you are interest
 ed in attending\, you must RSVP by September 20. We look forward to seein
 g you there!</p>
