BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:IU Maurer School of Law
DTSTART:20261211T230000Z
DTEND:20261212T020000Z
SUMMARY:Lights on the Square
UID:20261211T230000Z-2404949@events.iu.edu
DTSTAMP:20260902T093752Z
URL:https://events.iu.edu/lawiub/event/2404949-lights-on-the-square
LAST-MODIFIED:20260902T133752Z
X-LIVEWHALE-TYPE:events
X-LIVEWHALE-ID:2404949
X-LIVEWHALE-TIMEZONE:America/New_York
X-LIVEWHALE-SUMMARY:<p>\n  The Office of Graduate Programs and Global Eng
 agement will host its annual Lights on the Square Reception\, a semi-form
 al event celebrating the end of the semester (and the end of the exchange
  or degree program for some).\n</p>\n<p>\n  Join friends\, law school fac
 ulty and staff members\, and fellow students and scholars for a night of 
 fun that includes a photo booth\, social mixers and prize drawings. Delic
 ious and substantial "finger food" with vegan and gluten free options\, n
 on-alcoholic beverages\, and beer and wine (available to those over 21) w
 ill be served. Students will receive drink tickets at the door to use on 
 alcohol\, after that it will be a cash bar<strong>. Please provide a vali
 d ID.</strong>\n</p>\n<p>\n  All graduate and exchange students and visit
 ing scholars are welcome. Please RSVP no later than December 5th at 4PM t
 o attend. Attendees may invite up to two (2) guests if they wish. Please 
 contact <a href="mailto:eventlaw@indiana.edu">eventlaw@iu.edu</a> if you 
 would like to invite more than two friends or family members.\n</p>
X-LIVEWHALE-RSVP:1
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
